{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25906","headline":"和段相公夏登张仪楼 · 杨汝士","name":"和段相公夏登张仪楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从公城上来，秋近绝纤埃。\n楼古秦规在，江分蜀望开。\n远山标宿雪，末席本寒灰。\n陪赏今爲忝，临欢敢诉杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨汝士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}